	What is Assertions? - checkpoints
	Assertion can be achieved by using hard and soft assert in selenium webdriver
	if two values or condition matches - assertion pass.
	else fail
	
		1. Hard Assertion - checks the condition and value if matches it pass else stop the execution immideiatly
		2. Soft Assertion - checks the condition and value if matches it pass else it collects all error and log into
							reports after test execution over.
							
			Assert.assertTrue -- thats checks the conditions - isElementExists - 
			Assert.assertEquals - that checks the value	 -- title, getText 	
			only incase of softassert assertAll() - this would report all error in reports
			
			
			
			
