	How to skipping tstcases in testNG
		1. by using skipping exception (throw the error)
		2. safest way to skip testcases in testng (this can be achieved using testng.xml)
					enabled (default value is true)
					1. flag -- if values set as true | this will not skips the testcase during run.
					2. flag -- if values set as false | this will skips the testcase during run.
	
	
